# {{ RESOURCE_PATH }} license notice

## Automated verification

Automated verification collects the source metadata, content hash, detected
license data, and any license information supplied to this record. It does not
constitute legal review or approval by the repository owner or maintainers.
Set `automated_verification.status` to `completed` only after the workflow has
verified the recorded information against the source and license material.

## Notice Text

